.         *Generate household task values for each gender
.         gen H_errands_woman = pli0040*(sex == 2)
(46 missing values generated)

.         gen H_errands_man = pli0040*(sex == 1)
(46 missing values generated)

.         gen H_housework_woman = pli0043_h*(sex == 2)
(30 missing values generated)

.         gen H_housework_man = pli0043_h*(sex == 1)
(30 missing values generated)

.         gen H_childcare_woman = pli0044_h*(sex == 2)

.         gen H_childcare_man = pli0044_h*(sex == 1)

.         gen H_repairs_woman = pli0049_h*(sex == 2)
(2 missing values generated)

.         gen H_repairs_man = pli0049_h*(sex == 1)
(2 missing values generated)

.         
.         *Collapse to the original household level
.         collapse (mean) pgmonth kidsex01 (max) kidgeb01 kidmon01 (sum) H_erra
> nds_woman H_errands_man H_housework_woman H_housework_man H_childcare_woman H
> _childcare_man H_repairs_woman H_repairs_man, by(cid syear)

